### ProductShelf Integration Test - Manual HTTP Testing

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000/api
@adminToken = <replace with actual admin token>
@productId = <replace with actual product ID>
@shelfId = <replace with actual shelf ID>
@newShelfId = <replace with another shelf ID>

### 1. Get ProductShelf Statistics
GET {{baseUrl}}/product-shelves/stats

### 2. Get Shelves for a Product
GET {{baseUrl}}/product-shelves/product/{{productId}}/shelves

### 3. Get Products on a Shelf
GET {{baseUrl}}/product-shelves/shelf/{{shelfId}}/products

### 4. Get Products Available for Damaged Record
GET {{baseUrl}}/product-shelves/for-damaged-record

### 5. Assign Product to Shelf - Bulk
POST {{baseUrl}}/product-shelves/bulk/assign
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "product_ids": ["{{productId}}"],
  "shelf_id": "{{shelfId}}",
  "quantity_per_product": 20,
  "notes": "Initial shelf assignment"
}

### 6. Assign Multiple Products to Shelf
POST {{baseUrl}}/product-shelves/bulk/assign
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "product_ids": [
    "{{productId1}}",
    "{{productId2}}",
    "{{productId3}}"
  ],
  "shelf_id": "{{shelfId}}",
  "quantity_per_product": 15
}

### 7. Move Product to Different Shelf
PUT {{baseUrl}}/product-shelves/{{productId}}/move
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "from_shelf_id": "{{shelfId}}",
  "to_shelf_id": "{{newShelfId}}",
  "quantity": 5,
  "reason": "Shelf reorganization"
}

### 8. Move Product - Partial Quantity
PUT {{baseUrl}}/product-shelves/{{productId}}/move
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "from_shelf_id": "{{shelfId}}",
  "to_shelf_id": "{{newShelfId}}",
  "quantity": 3
}

### 9. Get Product-Shelf Mappings
GET {{baseUrl}}/product-shelves

### 10. Get All Products on Multiple Shelves
GET {{baseUrl}}/product-shelves/shelf/{{shelfId1}}/products
GET {{baseUrl}}/product-shelves/shelf/{{shelfId2}}/products

### 11. Get Shelf Status for Product
GET {{baseUrl}}/product-shelves/product/{{productId}}/shelves

### 12. Verify Product Placement After Move
GET {{baseUrl}}/product-shelves/product/{{productId}}/shelves

### 13. Get ProductShelf Statistics with Details
GET {{baseUrl}}/product-shelves/stats

### 14. Test Moving Product from Full Shelf
PUT {{baseUrl}}/product-shelves/{{productId}}/move
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "from_shelf_id": "{{fullShelfId}}",
  "to_shelf_id": "{{availableShelfId}}",
  "quantity": 10
}

### 15. Bulk Re-assign Products for Category
POST {{baseUrl}}/product-shelves/bulk/assign
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "product_ids": ["{{electronicsProductId1}}", "{{electronicsProductId2}}"],
  "shelf_id": "{{electronicsShelfId}}",
  "quantity_per_product": 25,
  "category": "Electronics"
}

### 16. Get Available Placement for Product
GET {{baseUrl}}/product-shelves/available-placement?product_id={{productId}}&category=Electronics
